        </div>
        <p class="mgdb-metric-description">USDA SCINet high-performance network connectivity with auto-resume transfer.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="mgdb-metric">
        <div class="mgdb-metric-top">
          <h3>NAM Founders</h3>
          <span class="mgdb-metric-badge">Diversity</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mgdb-metric-stat">
          <strong class="mgdb-metric-value">26</strong>
        </div>
        <p class="mgdb-metric-description">Chromosome-scale de novo founder assemblies and comprehensive annotations.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="mgdb-metric">
        <div class="mgdb-metric-top">
          <h3>Dataset Categories</h3>
          <span class="mgdb-metric-badge">Thematic</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mgdb-metric-stat">
          <strong class="mgdb-metric-value">10+</strong>
        </div>
