  <section id="downloads-related" class="mgdb-panel download-bottom-section" aria-labelledby="downloads-related-heading">
    <h2 id="downloads-related-heading" class="mgdb-panel-title">Connected Genomics &amp; Analysis Platforms</h2>
    <p class="mgdb-panel-lead">Explore interactive browsers, analytical tools, and guidelines for citing data downloaded from MaizeGDB.</p>

    <div class="download-related-grid">
