        <div class="download-related-title">B73 Reference Assembly Center</div>
        <p class="download-related-desc">Explore version histories \(v1&ndash;v5\), GenBank chromosome accessions, and FASTA/GFF metrics.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="download-related-card" href="/genomebrowser">
        <div class="download-related-title">Genome Browser Data Hub</div>
        <p class="download-related-desc">Visualize assemblies and tracks in next-gen JBrowse 2, linear synteny viewers, and classic JBrowse 1.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="download-related-card" href="/genetic_variation">
        <div class="download-related-title">Genetic Variation Center</div>
        <p class="download-related-desc">Query SNPs, structural variations, and resequencing catalogs across diverse lines.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="download-related-card" href="/expression">
        <div class="download-related-title">Expression Data Hub</div>
        <p class="download-related-desc">Explore qTeller RNA-seq expression profiles and multi-tissue transcriptomics matrices.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="download-related-card" href="https://feta.maizegdb.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <div class="download-related-title">FETA Functional Enrichment &#8599;</div>
        <p class="download-related-desc">Perform multi-ontology functional enrichment analysis across B73 and NAM proteomes.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="download-related-card" href="/cite">
        <div class="download-related-title">Citing MaizeGDB &amp; Data Sources</div>
